    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1010910/extras/569ed32b689388c124db36972b606d4c.poster.avif?t=1751986039\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1010910/extras/569ed32b689388c124db36972b606d4c.webm?t=1751986039\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1010910/extras/569ed32b689388c124db36972b606d4c.mp4?t=1751986039\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><strong>SHORT BACKSTORY</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">An interstellar spacecraft fell and crashed into pieces on a distant planet. The spaceship contained cargo with a dangerous power source. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">The spacecraft was home to a knowledgeable nation called Indefinite, which could only live underwater. They flew to collect resources from that planet, but something went wrong and they crashed on the planet.  </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1010910/extras/69e4684c2899fd65df1d377af376dcd4.poster.avif?t=1751986039\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1010910/extras/69e4684c2899fd65df1d377af376dcd4.webm?t=1751986039\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1010910/extras/69e4684c2899fd65df1d377af376dcd4.mp4?t=1751986039\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div> </p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><strong>EXPLORE MULTIPLE CYCLES OF LIFE</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Join five nations in a world where the hero's journey begins as a human but can take many unexpected turns. Step onto infected biomass and transform into a monster. Die and be reborn as a demon. Return to life once more as a human if you return souls to the underground world as a demon. Harness ancient artifacts to evolve into a mystical being. And ultimately, uncover the true identity of the enigmatic Indefinite Nation.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1010910/extras/86f708a14015cc9df3ba849a46bd9487.poster.avif?t=1751986039\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1010910/extras/86f708a14015cc9df3ba849a46bd9487.webm?t=1751986039\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1010910/extras/86f708a14015cc9df3ba849a46bd9487.mp4?t=1751986039\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><strong>DISCOVER A COMPLEX, DARK STORY</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Many humans have evolved to become monsters because of an epidemic. Those who have not survived that epidemic are taken by death and chosen to be part of the undead army, or use artifacts and become a mystic creature. Only a few become slaves of an unknown nation.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Rise from the ashes, seize new lands, and forge an army for the battles ahead, battles that will unveil the truth of these territories and the secrets they conceal.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1010910/extras/484460a50f16b78d2ea68dc3f4719e7c.poster.avif?t=1751986039\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1010910/extras/484460a50f16b78d2ea68dc3f4719e7c.webm?t=1751986039\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1010910/extras/484460a50f16b78d2ea68dc3f4719e7c.mp4?t=1751986039\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><strong>UNCOVER TWISTING PLOTS AND UNPREDICTABLE NARRATIVE TURNS</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">In a world where power dictates everything, and only those with power can earn respect and dominate other nations, a unique group of soldiers is known as Empire Patrons. These individuals possess particles of magical energy within their bodies, granting them a rare form of force sensitivity. Tasked with scouring the world for unique magical resources called artifacts, they find what the rulers desperately seek to maintain their control and dominance.</p>",
    "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1010910/extras/569ed32b689388c124db36972b606d4c.poster.avif?t=1751986039\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1010910/extras/569ed32b689388c124db36972b606d4c.webm?t=1751986039\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1010910/extras/569ed32b689388c124db36972b606d4c.mp4?t=1751986039\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><strong>SHORT BACKSTORY</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">An interstellar spacecraft fell and crashed into pieces on a distant planet. The spaceship contained cargo with a dangerous power source. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">The spacecraft was home to a knowledgeable nation called Indefinite, which could only live underwater. They flew to collect resources from that planet, but something went wrong and they crashed on the planet.  </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1010910/extras/69e4684c2899fd65df1d377af376dcd4.poster.avif?t=1751986039\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1010910/extras/69e4684c2899fd65df1d377af376dcd4.webm?t=1751986039\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1010910/extras/69e4684c2899fd65df1d377af376dcd4.mp4?t=1751986039\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div> </p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><strong>EXPLORE MULTIPLE CYCLES OF LIFE</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Join five nations in a world where the hero's journey begins as a human but can take many unexpected turns. Step onto infected biomass and transform into a monster. Die and be reborn as a demon. Return to life once more as a human if you return souls to the underground world as a demon. Harness ancient artifacts to evolve into a mystical being. And ultimately, uncover the true identity of the enigmatic Indefinite Nation.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1010910/extras/86f708a14015cc9df3ba849a46bd9487.poster.avif?t=1751986039\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1010910/extras/86f708a14015cc9df3ba849a46bd9487.webm?t=1751986039\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1010910/extras/86f708a14015cc9df3ba849a46bd9487.mp4?t=1751986039\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><strong>DISCOVER A COMPLEX, DARK STORY</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Many humans have evolved to become monsters because of an epidemic. Those who have not survived that epidemic are taken by death and chosen to be part of the undead army, or use artifacts and become a mystic creature. Only a few become slaves of an unknown nation.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Rise from the ashes, seize new lands, and forge an army for the battles ahead, battles that will unveil the truth of these territories and the secrets they conceal.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1010910/extras/484460a50f16b78d2ea68dc3f4719e7c.poster.avif?t=1751986039\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1010910/extras/484460a50f16b78d2ea68dc3f4719e7c.webm?t=1751986039\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1010910/extras/484460a50f16b78d2ea68dc3f4719e7c.mp4?t=1751986039\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><strong>UNCOVER TWISTING PLOTS AND UNPREDICTABLE NARRATIVE TURNS</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">In a world where power dictates everything, and only those with power can earn respect and dominate other nations, a unique group of soldiers is known as Empire Patrons. These individuals possess particles of magical energy within their bodies, granting them a rare form of force sensitivity. Tasked with scouring the world for unique magical resources called artifacts, they find what the rulers desperately seek to maintain their control and dominance.</p>",
